NecromancerBalance is UtilityFunctions

// Ours (guild revamp, ADR 0022 decision 27, 2026-10-23): this kept the old
// Necromancer/Hunter scenario in balance: the Amulet of the Three and Sword
// of the Hunt generators, their hunger tuned from PK statistics, and the
// Order of Necromancers. The scenario was unreachable after the faction
// revamp (the two artifacts are Champion's Gifts now) and its code is gone;
// see git history for it. The system no longer creates one; the class stays,
// empty, so a saved world that has one still loads.

constants:

   include blakston.khd

resources:

classvars:

properties:

messages:

end
